[00:30.61] I've tried to mend
[00:32.87] The love that ended
[00:35.66] Long ago although we still pretend
[00:40.87] Our love is surely coming to an end
[00:46.27] Don't waste the time you've got to love again
[00:53.03] We tried to lie
[00:54.71] But you and I
[00:57.24] Know better than to let each other lie
[01:02.41] The thought of lying to you makes me cry
[01:08.23] Counting up the time that's passed us by
